    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like a \"search\" though. it just feels like... empty. like the floor is gone and i'm just falling. what's the point of trying to \"rebuild\" anything if the whole concept of a foundation was just a lie we told ourselves to stay calm? it feels like i'm just wasting time pretending there's a meaning that isn't there.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
